## 📚 Documentation & Conventions

**All architectural and coding patterns are documented in the `.ai/` directory.**

### Quick Reference

- **Start here:** `.ai/AI_PROTOCOL.md` - How to work with this repo
- **Feature work:** `.ai/features/*.md` - Feature-specific changelogs
- **Architecture:** `.ai/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- **API patterns:** `.ai/CONVENTIONS_API.md`
- **UI patterns:** `.ai/CONVENTIONS_UI.md`
- **Workers:** `.ai/CONVENTIONS_WORKERS.md`
- **Database:** `.ai/PRISMA_PATTERNS.md`
- **Genome browsers:** `.ai/GENOME_BROWSER_NOTES.md`
- **Common mistakes:** `.ai/PITFALLS.md`

### Priority Order of Truth

1. `.ai/features/<feature>.md` (highest)
2. Other `.ai/` documentation
3. Repository code
4. Chat history (lowest)

**Chats explore. Changelogs decide. Files persist.**

